source https://api.nuget.org/v3/index.json

storage: none

nuget FSharp.Analyzers.SDK 0.36.0

// Vendored fork of FSharpLint (branch fcs-43.13, commit 50e34b16 in paket.lock;
// fix/sourcelink-security-20260912 at 08f601af plus the FCS 43.13 port): upstream v0.27.0 plus
//  - a TransparentCompiler guard: FSharpProjectContext.ProjectOptions throws when
//    check results come from FCS's TransparentCompiler (the shim's host uses it),
//    so the fork degrades it to None instead of failing the file; upstream Lint.fs
//    is unguarded;
//  - build-time security fixes: Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub 10.0.303 (patched
//    Microsoft.Build.Tasks.Git, CVE-2026-62900) and NuGet.Protocol 6.12.5 in the
//    build script (GHSA-g4vj-cjjj-v7hg);
//  - FCS 43.13.101 / FSharp.Core 11.0.101 pins (the .NET 11 band; record spreads), and lazy breadcrumb/source
//    extraction in UselessBinding and FavourIgnoreOverLetWild for large files.
//  - an ignoreFiles matcher whose `**` segment matches zero or more directories
//    (upstream matches exactly one).
// Waiting on fsprojects/FSharpLint#872 (project-context wrapper). Once it ships in an
// upstream release or nightly, drop this git-dep and use upstream FSharpLint.Core.
git https://github.com/michaelglass/FSharpLint.git fcs-43.13
